  <item>
    <title>从勇闯印度IT届到运动品牌创业先锋：放弃一加手机全球市场负责人职位和苹果offer后从零创业的心路历程</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675afb307d8426f692a4f3c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675afb307d8426f692a4f3c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>阿丁，一位曾在ONEPLUS、腾讯工作的新晋创业者，分享了他在印度、一加手机，以及后来负责全球市场的精彩职场经历。英语差却能横跨中外团队，主动请战印度市场，一支神奇的广告提升了20%市场份额，让一加在当时超越苹果成为印度市场第一。阿丁如何在印度的职场险境中，突破自我，成为市场英雄?这些经历和逆袭背后隐藏着什么样的故事?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a> 跨越国界的挑战:我在印度管理市场的经历与教训&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">00:04:05</a> 从中国市场到印度市场:探索创新思维的冒险之旅&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">00:07:22</a> 体验不同人生的奇妙之旅:在印度的工作挑战与机遇&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">00:11:06</a> 中国品牌在印度:从失落到骄傲的里程碑时刻!&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">00:14:49</a> 30w租的摄影棚不如一台gopro:创意营销的瞬间决策与显著提升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">00:22:12</a> 追寻梦想:我是一定要做FOUNDRER的创业之路&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">00:25:54</a> 创业者的视角:大公司经验对创业的帮助与挑战&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">00:29:38</a> 创业者的心路历程:压力、成长和成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">00:33:20</a> 追求远方与现实代价:职场环境下的挑战与选择&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">00:37:03</a> 职业选择:悦已还是悦人?探索兴趣与事业的平衡点&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">00:40:45</a> 如何在小公司中获得成功?工作经验的重要性与职场幻想的对比</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
